{"strongs": "H3063", "word": "יְהוּדָה", "translit": "ye.hu.dah", "root": "יהודה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Judah", "definition": "יְהוּדָה 820 proper name, masculine and of a territory Judah (treated Gen 29:35 ; Gen 49:8 (q. v. below) as if derived from Hoph`al of ידה = praised, object of praise (on ה compare Hiph`il אֲהוֺדֶ֑נּוּ Ps 28:7 , יְהוֺדֶה Neh 11:17 ), but this dubious; relation to יְהֻד , II. יְהוּדִית : unexplained; see further Jastr JBL xii, 1898, 61 ff. ; Assyrian Ia-u-du, of land; Ia-u-da-ai, Judaean COT Gloss ) — I. proper name, masculine 1. son of Jacob and Leah , explained by Leah's words I will praise ׳ י Gen 29:35 ( J ); compare Jacob's prediction, thy brethren shall praise thee Gen 49:8 (poem in J E ), see also v Gen 49:9 v Gen 49:10 elsewhere Gen 37:26 ; Gen 38:1 + 14 t. Gen 38 ; Gen 43:3 ; Gen 43:8 ; Gen 44:14 ; Gen 44:16 ; Gen 44:18 ; Gen 46:28 (all J ), Gen 35:23 ( P ), 1Chr 2:1 ; 1Chr 2:3 ; Ruth 4:12 בְּנֵי יְהוּדָה sons of Judah Gen 46:12 ; Num 26:19 ( P ), 1Chr 2:3 ; 1Chr 2:4 ; 1Chr 4:1 . 2. tribe descended from Judah Deut 33:7 (poem), Num 1:7 ( P ), Deut 27:12 +; בְּנֵי יהודה Num 1:26 ; Josh 14:6 ( D ), Judg 1:8 +; שֵׁבֶט יהודה Josh 7:16 ( J ), 1Kgs 12:20 ; 2Kgs 17:18 ; Ps 78:68 מַטֵּה בְנֵי יהודה Josh 15:1 ; Josh 15:20 ; Josh 15:21 ; Josh 21:9 (all P ), 1Chr 6:50 elsewhere מַטֵּה יהודה Exod 31:2 ; Exod 35:30 ; Exod 38:22 ; Num 1:27 ; Num 7:12 ; Num 13:6 ; Num 34:19 ; Josh 7:1 ; Josh 7:18 ; Josh 21:4 (all P ); אישׁ יהודה Judg 15:20 +; אנשׁי יהודה 2Sam 2:4 +, (compare amelûti [ƒabê] Ia-u-du Tel el-Amarna No. 39 Jastr JBL xii, 1893, 64 ). 3. nation , of southern kingdom under dynasty of David, as distinguished from northern kingdom of Ephraim or Israel: Hos 4:15 ; Jer 2:28 ; 2Chr 12:12 +; of the returned exiles Neh 4:4 עַם יהודה 2Kgs 14:21 = 2Chr 26:1 ; Jer 25:1 ; Jer 25:2 ; Ezra 4:4 בְּנֵי יהודה Hos 2:2 ; Jer 7:30 ; 2Chr 13:18 ; 2Chr 25:12 ; 2Chr 28:10 בֵּית יהודה Hos 1:7 ; Jer 3:18 ; Ezek 4:6 +; מַלְ